        "https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%BA%83%E9%99%B5%E7%94%BA&oldid=108696598",
  },
  {
    "id": "29426:wikipedia:2f8bd9ee4f76",
    "cityId": "29426",
    "category": "文化財",
    "text": "広陵町の三吉石塚古墳は、奈良県の史跡です。",
